msgstr "تجهيز خامات متغيرات الخدمة"

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:workorder_service_components.service_component_batch_form
msgid "Apply to Variants"
msgstr "تطبيق على المتغيرات"

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:workorder_service_components.service_component_batch_form
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "إلغاء"

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:workorder_service_components.service_component_batch_form
msgid ""
"Apply these materials to every selected variant. Existing materials on the "
"same vehicle part are updated by product; other materials are kept. Existing"
" work orders keep their saved materials."
msgstr ""
"تُطبّق الخامات على كل المتغيرات المختارة. تُحدّث الخامة الموجودة في نفس جزء "
"السيارة حسب الصنف، وتبقى الخامات الأخرى. تحتفظ أوامر العمل الحالية بخاماتها "
"المحفوظة."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:workorder_service_components.product_template_form_service_components
msgid ""
"Save the service first. Use Configure Multiple Variants to apply the same "
"materials to several variants, or open an individual vehicle part to edit "
"its materials."
msgstr ""
"احفظ الخدمة أولًا. استخدم تجهيز خامات عدة متغيرات لتطبيق نفس الخامات على "
"أكثر من متغير، أو افتح جزء سيارة لتعديل خاماته."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid "Only workshop managers can configure service materials."
msgstr "يمكن لمديري الورشة فقط تجهيز خامات الخدمات."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid "Select a service, at least one variant and at least one material."
msgstr "اختر خدمة ومتغيرًا واحدًا وخامة واحدة على الأقل."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid "All variants must belong to the selected service template."
msgstr "يجب أن تنتمي جميع المتغيرات إلى الخدمة الرئيسية المختارة."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid "Do not add the same material and category more than once."
msgstr "لا تضف نفس الخامة والتصنيف أكثر من مرة."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid ""
"This part has duplicate materials. Review its existing configuration first."
msgstr "يوجد تكرار للخامات في هذا الجزء. راجع الإعداد الحالي أولًا."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid "Select a main material category."
msgstr "اختر تصنيف خامات رئيسيًا."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid ""
"Select a storable material from the selected category or its subcategories."
msgstr "اختر خامة مخزنية من التصنيف المحدد أو تصنيفاته الفرعية."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid "Enter a positive quantity and a compatible unit of measure."
msgstr "أدخل كمية أكبر من صفر ووحدة قياس متوافقة."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid ""
"The replacement material must be a storable product in the configured "
"category or its subcategories."
msgstr ""
"يجب أن تكون الخامة البديلة صنفًا مخزنيًا من التصنيف المحدد أو تصنيفاته "
"الفرعية."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid "The configured material category cannot be changed on this work order."
msgstr "لا يمكن تغيير تصنيف الخامة المحدد في أمر العمل."

#. module: workorder_service_components
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/component_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_category.py:0
#: code:addons/workorder_service_components/models/material_execution.py:0
msgid "Select a storable replacement material."
msgstr "اختر خامة بديلة من الأصناف المخزنية."
